      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-outline",
      "description": "대표 버튼과 겹치는 본문 행동, 둘째 행동.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-outline\">직접 추가</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-outline{width:100%;height:48px;border:1px solid var(--color-line-strong,#878c95);border-radius:4px;background:#fff;color:var(--color-ink,#18202b);font-size:16px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}.ds-btn-outline:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-sign,#1f4fa3);outline-offset:2px}.ds-btn-outline:disabled{opacity:.4}"
    },
    {
      "name": "선택 칩",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip-selected",
      "description": "하나만 고르는 칩. 선택은 파랑.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-checked=\"true\">오늘</button><button class=\"ds-chip\" aria-checked=\"false\">내일</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:8px}.ds-chip{height:44px;padding:0 14px;border:1px solid var(--color-line-strong,#878c95);border-radius:3px;background:#fff;color:var(--color-ink,#18202b);font-size:15px;cursor:pointer}.ds-chip[aria-checked=true]{border-color:var(--color-sign,#1f4fa3);background:var(--color-sign,#1f4fa3);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-sign,#1f4fa3);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "공정 막대",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "stage-meter-filled",
      "description": "터·골조·완성 세 칸. 시그니처.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i></span><span class=\"ds-meter paused\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i><i></i></span>",
      "css": ".ds-meter{display:flex;gap:3px;width:96px;margin:6px 0}.ds-meter i{flex:1;height:5px;background:var(--color-surface-3,#e8e6e0)}.ds-meter i.on{background:var(--color-caution,#f2c230)}.ds-meter.paused i.on{background:var(--color-line-strong,#878c95)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "가림막 건물 띠",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "hoarding-strip",
      "description": "오늘 화면 안내판 아래에 붙는 건물 패널.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-hoard\"><li><div class=\"ds-ph\">오피스</div><b>오피스</b><span class=\"ds-meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>터</small></li><li><div class=\"ds-ph\">체육관</div><b>체육관</b><span class=\"ds-meter\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i></span><small>골조</small></li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-hoard{display:flex;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;background:var(--color-surface-2,#f4f3ef);border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-line,#e6e3dc)}.ds-hoard li{position:relative;flex:1;padding:12px 10px 10px;border-right:1px solid var(--color-line,#e6e3dc)}.ds-hoard li:last-child{border-right:0}.ds-hoard li::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0 0 auto;height:5px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,var(--color-sign,#1f4fa3) 0 14px,#fff 14px 20px)}.ds-ph{display:grid;place-items:center;aspect-ratio:1;border-radius:4px;background:var(--color-placeholder,#d6d6d6);color:var(--color-ink-2,#434a56);font-size:13px}.ds-hoard b{display:block;margin-top:8px;font-family:var(--font-display,'Do Hyeon'),sans-serif;font-weight:400;font-size:16px}.ds-hoard small{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-ink-3,#5b6270)}.ds-meter{display:flex;gap:3px}.ds-meter i{flex:1;height:5px;background:var(--color-surface-3,#e8e6e0)}.ds-meter i.on{background:var(--color-caution,#f2c230)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "할 일 줄",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "check-done",
      "description": "둥근 체크는 완료(파랑).",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-tasks\"><li><span class=\"ds-check done\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></span><span><b class=\"done\">관심 공고 정리하기</b><small>백엔드 개발자로 취업하기</small></span></li><li><span class=\"ds-check\"></span><span><b>지원동기 첫 문단 쓰기</b><small>백엔드 개발자로 취업하기</small></span></li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-tasks{margin:0;padding:0 8px;list-style:none}.ds-tasks li{display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:flex-start;padding:4px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-line,#e6e3dc)}.ds-check{flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:22px;height:22px;margin:11px;border:2px solid var(--color-line-strong,#878c95);border-radius:50%;box-sizing:border-box;font-size:12px;color:#fff}.ds-check.done{border-color:var(--color-sign,#1f4fa3);background:var(--color-sign,#1f4fa3)}.ds-tasks b{display:block;padding-top:10px;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;color:var(--color-ink,#18202b)}.ds-tasks b.done{color:var(--color-ink-3,#5b6270);text-decoration:line-through}.ds-tasks small{display:block;padding-bottom:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--color-ink-3,#5b6270)}"
    },
    {
